<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are seizing homes in Mexico City while a Gulf Cartel leader's arrest has sparked renewed fighting in northern Mexico, and a mayor who opposed cartels was assassinated, prompting his son’s detention and a brief halt of trucker protests that later resumed after talks with authorities. Federal agents indicted engineer Luis Manuel Hernandez Victoria for building a 1,900‑foot cross-border drug tunnel and brought terrorism charges against him, and a large drug operation was uncovered in San Diego County. A 7‑year-old American girl was among six dead in cartel violence in Matamoros. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky Sports&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;Formula 1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Just Jared&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOb1ktZHRCc0luUWVFVU9qcVk0bm5YOHNaV2N6Z2ljQUFDWmtSS2VMS1dueUYzbURlLVRLVnVSQ1ktV3dzc2paNHp5aFp1c3B1WUNhXzVxd1UzdXNxMERrSlVNbkpfeE5JNThnRWg3MUNrMmNjNjZHazBwaHhDbXQ4bGNFTVQ5ZUU2cERKcWZ6V1Y3eVFJSlBiVjM1eHRFdFFkRE5QckV4eFM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Formula 1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new